      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also stumbling across this as I (tried to) look up how to access bone angle as a parameter so that I could tie it to a corrective blendshape. Physbones are SO CLOSE to working for this, but all that their parameterization provides is the total amount of deflection without specifying direction, which is more or less useless for this purpose...",
